                                                "sense_id": "1c925afb-f8a7-3708-bfd6-61d96fb318df",
                                                "text": "A three-alarm fire tore through a family home on Newark's East Side early Saturday morning, completely gutting the two-story residence and tragically claiming a half-sleeve of Oreo cookies that was trapped inside a cupboard."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
